Synthesizing this movement data helps approximate the evolving stock levels at each location. Specifically, location A’s net change indicates an increase of 15 units (27 received minus 12 sent), reflecting a moderate stock buildup. Location B, however, shows a more modest net gain of 9 units (18 received minus 9 sent). Location C, receiving 35 units and with no indicated outgoing movements, effectively registers the largest net positive shift, suggesting a significant stock accumulation.

