| 89B     | B               | Letter       |
| 345     | nan             | Number       |

This fabricated table emphasizes the central role of suffix letters in distinguishing categories, mirroring the behavior observed in the primary data under review.

In summary, the classification mechanism clearly hinges on the identification of specific letter suffixes appended to numeric strings. This approach provides a straightforward yet robust rule set that cleanly divides the entries into their respective categories without overlap or exceptions in the dataset.

