| Categories          | Functional category                                         |
| Process             | Gene Ontology "biological process"                          |
| Function            | Gene Ontology "molecular function"                          |
| Compartement        | Gene Ontology "component"                                   |
| Phenotype           | Phenotype from Saccharomyces Genome Database (10/2003)      |
