=== Report ===
A comparative assessment of two consecutive months reveals a dynamic trajectory in both financial performance and cost structure. Examining ## Sheet: Sheet1

| Unnamed: 0   |   2012-01-12 00:00:00 |   2012-02-12 00:00:00 |
|:-------------|----------------------:|----------------------:|
