| Oil                            | 0.525     |        3.25 | 400           | Yellow   |
| Gas                            | 0.616     |        2.93 | 300           | Black    |
| Wine                           | 0.675     |        2.75 | 250           | Red      |
| Beer                           | 0.746     |        2.57 | 200           | Green    |
| Creme                          | 0.835     |        2.38 | 150           | White    |
